<name>Cosmic Ascii Battery</name>
<summary>Battery style applet for cosmic desktop</summary>
<description>
<p>
  Shows battery percentage and charge level as a compact block-character bar
  directly in the COSMIC panel. Click it to open a popup for switching power
  profiles, adjusting screen brightness with an ASCII slider, and choosing
  an accent color.
</p>
</description>
